    <string name="mic_permission_title">InTune needs your microphone</string>
    <string name="mic_permission_intro">To tune, InTune listens to your instrument. Sound is analysed on your phone and never recorded or sent anywhere.</string>
    <string name="mic_permission_rationale">Without the microphone InTune can\'t hear your strings, so it can\'t tell whether they\'re in tune. Sound never leaves your phone.</string>
    <string name="mic_permission_settings_hint">Microphone access is turned off for InTune. Open Settings, tap Permissions, then Microphone, and choose Allow.</string>
